        "id": 1042276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-10T17:41:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This would be needed if different UIDs could reach the service.  But since you\u0027ll have to allow only shell to find this service in SELinux anyway, wouldn\u0027t it be enough?",
      "parentUuid": "768742fa_6f5e5bd6",
      "revId": "c14ba104c8b0715ad70d507ee2023fbeea43d0fd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
